---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact Us
bodyClass: contact
permalink: /contact/
---

{# AI AGENT: Customize this page for your niche. Update the email address,
   social media links, and FAQs to be relevant to your audience.
   Consider adding a contact form via Formspree, Basin, or Netlify Forms. #}

<article class="page-content">
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>

  <p>
    Have a question about our product recommendations or our site?
    We'd love to hear from you!
  </p>

  <section class="contact-info">
    <h2>Get In Touch</h2>

    <div class="contact-methods">
      <div class="contact-method">
        <h3>Email</h3>
        {# AI AGENT: Replace with your actual contact email #}
        <p><a href="mailto:hello@{{ site.url | replace('https://', '') }}">hello@{{ site.url | replace('https://', '') }}</a></p>
        <p class="note">We try to respond to all emails within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      {% if site.social %}
      <div class="contact-method">
        <h3>Social Media</h3>
        <ul>
          {% if site.social.facebook %}<li><a href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a></li>{% endif %}
          {% if site.social.instagram %}<li><a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>{% endif %}
          {% if site.social.twitter %}<li><a href="{{ site.social.twitter }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter / X</a></li>{% endif %}
          {% if site.social.youtube %}<li><a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a></li>{% endif %}
          {% if site.social.pinterest %}<li><a href="{{ site.social.pinterest }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pinterest</a></li>{% endif %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    {# AI AGENT: Replace these generic FAQs with questions specific to your niche.
       Think about what your target audience actually asks. #}

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How can I buy a product?</h3>
      <p>
        All products on our site are available through Amazon. Simply click on any product
        to be taken to its Amazon listing where you can complete your purchase.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3>
      <p>
        Shipping depends on the individual product and Amazon's policies.
        Check the product page on Amazon for your region's availability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I return a product?</h3>
      <p>
        Return policies are determined by Amazon. Check the product listing for
        specific return information.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Are your recommendations unbiased?</h3>
      <p>
        Yes. We choose products based on quality and value. Our affiliate relationship
        with Amazon means we earn a commission from sales, but this doesn't influence
        our recommendations. <a href="/disclosure/">Read our full disclosure.</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# FAQ structured data (JSON-LD) — helps FAQs appear in Google "People Also Ask" #}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How can I buy a product?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "All products on our site are available through Amazon. Simply click on any product to be taken to its Amazon listing where you can complete your purchase."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you ship internationally?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Shipping depends on the individual product and Amazon's policies. Check the product page on Amazon for your region's availability."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I return a product?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Return policies are determined by Amazon. Check the product listing for specific return information."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Are your recommendations unbiased?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We choose products based on quality and value. Our affiliate relationship with Amazon means we earn a commission from sales, but this doesn't influence our recommendations."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <section class="contact-form-section">
    <h2>Send us a Message</h2>
    {# AI AGENT: Set up a contact form using Formspree (free tier), Basin, or similar.
       Uncomment and update the form below with your service's endpoint.

    <form action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID" method="POST">
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Send Message</button>
    </form>
    #}
    <p class="note">Contact form coming soon. In the meantime, reach out via email above.</p>
  </section>
</article>
